            "How decisive is the signal given the CI bands? "
            "Quote the specific Day-1 and final-day median and confidence.\n\n"
            "## 2. Uncertainty Decomposition\n"
            "Interpret the aleatoric vs epistemic uncertainty split. "
            "Is the market inherently noisy (aleatoric dominant) or is the "
            "model confused (epistemic dominant)? What does this imply?\n\n"
            "## 3. Model Credibility Assessment\n"
            "Evaluate the NLL loss and backtest metrics. "
            "Is >55% directional accuracy statistically meaningful? "
            "Is the Sharpe ratio of signals credible?\n\n"
            "## 4. Risk Management\n"
            "From the 95% CI lower band: what is the worst-case scenario? "
            "Suggest a stop-loss price and position size fraction (Kelly-based).\n\n"
            "## 5. Trade Setup\n"
            "Entry price, target, stop-loss, and R:R ratio. "
